[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

; ── This is a minimal starter theme. ──────────────────────────────────────────
; Godot 4 themes use StyleBoxFlat for Panel/Button backgrounds.
; Expand this file as you refine the visual design of each page.
;
; Recommended approach:
;   1. Open this .tres in the Godot Theme editor (Inspector → Edit)
;   2. Adjust colors, fonts, and margins there — Godot writes the
;      changes back into this file automatically.
;
; Key colors used in the mockup:
;   Background primary:   #FFFFFF
;   Background secondary: #F5F5F3
;   Accent (blue):        #378ADD
;   Border:               #E0DED8  (0.5px equivalent → use as StyleBox border width = 1)
;   Text primary:         #1A1A18
;   Text secondary:       #6B6A65
;   Success:              #1D9E75
;   Warning:              #BA7517
;   Danger:               #A32D2D
